"Easy Digital Downloads debug logs can be found at Downloads > Tools > Debug "
"Log"
msgstr ""
"يمكن العثور على سجلات تصحيح الأخطاء في Easy Digital Downloads في قسم "
"التنزيلات > الأدوات > سجل تصحيح الأخطاء"

#: classes/wwpdf-settings-edd.php:412
msgid "Leave No Trace"
msgstr "لا تترك أثراً"

#: classes/wwpdf-settings-edd.php:413
msgid ""
"If this box is checked and you uninstall PDF Ink Lite, all your settings will "
"be deleted from your Wordpress database."
msgstr ""
"إذا تم تحديد هذا المربع وقمت بإلغاء تثبيت PDF Ink Lite، فسيتم حذف جميع "
"إعداداتك من قاعدة بيانات Wordpress."

#: classes/wwpdf-settings-woo.php:73
msgid ""
"New with PDF Ink Lite v4: marked PDF files are stored in the wp-content/"
"uploads/pdf-ink/ folder for easier management."
msgstr ""
"الجديد في PDF Ink Lite v4: يتم تخزين ملفات PDF المحددة في مجلد wp-content/"
"uploads/pdf-ink/ لتسهيل إدارتها."

#: classes/wwpdf-settings-woo.php:80
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Marked PDF files will accumulate in your PDF folder whether using Force "
"downloads or not. To keep your server tidy, manually delete ad lib or <a "
"href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">upgrade this plugin</a> for "
