msgstr " حساس لحالة الأحرف."

#: classes/wwpdf-settings-woo.php:146
msgid "Enable New Logic?"
msgstr "تمكين منطق جديد؟"

#: classes/wwpdf-settings-woo.php:147
msgid ""
"If this box is checked, it changes how the `File(s) to Watermark` field above "
